.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH QUIPU-ALIGN-PROPOSE 1 "" quipu "Quipu Manual"
.SH NAME
quipu\-align\-propose \- Propose scored alignments between two named graphs as an SSSOM set
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBquipu align propose\fR [\fB\-\-db\fR] [\fB\-\-set\-id\fR] [\fB\-\-out\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIgraph\-a\fR> <\fIgraph\-b\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Propose scored alignments between two named graphs as an SSSOM set
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-db\fR \fI<PATH>\fR
Store file (default: .bobbin/quipu/quipu.db; configuration may override it)
.TP
\fB\-\-set\-id\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR
Identifier for the proposed alignment set
.TP
\fB\-\-out\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR
Output file
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIgraph\-a\fR>

.TP
<\fIgraph\-b\fR>

